WEBVTT

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.936
physical impairments as they age,

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:36.456
and they are likely to be seen
to be living much more vital, exciting --

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.696
JF: And longer --

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.936
LT: Joyful lives.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.856
JF: We live five years longer than men.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.936
LT: I think I'd trade the years for joy.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.640
(Laughter)

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.976
LT: But the most important
part is they found --

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.856
the results were so exciting
and so conclusive --

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:54.776
the researchers found

00:04:54.800 --> 00:05:00.536
that not having close female friends
is detrimental to your health,